jab mehfile yazeed me daaqil haram hue<br>
ghash aaya har qadam pa ye zulmo sitam hue<br>
zainab pukaari haadese aise bhi kam hue<br>
sar kat gaya hussain ka sar nange ham hue<br>
<br>
kyu aasmaan gir nahi padta dohaayi hai<br>
zahra ki beti saamne haakim ke aayi hai<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
moujood anjuman me sagheero kabeer hai<br>
haakim ke gird kursiyo'n pa sab ameer hai<br>
qaasaane zuljalaal zaleelo haqeer hai<br>
mushkil kusha ke qurdo kalaa'n sab aseer hai<br>
<br>
kehde koi ali se ye darussalaam me<br>
zainab ka daaqela hua darbaare aam me<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
hokar aseer duqtare haatim jo aayi thi<br>
nana ne mere qud ise chaadar udhaayi thi<br>
poshaak amma ne nayi isko pinhaai thi<br>
sab ko ye paas tha ke saqi ki wo jaai hai<br>
<br>
ummat ko haaye paas rasoole quda nahi<br>
zainab barahna sar hai aur unko haya nahi<br>
____________________________<br>
<br>
baba ko mere pucho to kaisa saqi hai wo <br>
mushkil kusha hai kul ka quda ka wali hai wo<br>
nana ko mere dekho sab ka wali hai wo<br>
bhai ke sadqe faqre nabi-o ali hai wo<br>
<br>
meri qabar aseeri me leta nahi koi<br>
kapda bhi mu chupaane ko deta nahi koi<br>
